  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-10-25T11:13:06.829Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I am pleased to see the recently implemented 'Sticker' function, which I find both useful and interesting.\n\nI would like to request an increase in the maximum number of stickers allowed in the sticker function. Currently, the maximum number of stickers is 9, which is insufficient for my needs. I would greatly appreciate it if you could provide a solution that allows me to use at least twice as many stickers, or more if possible.\n\nThank you for your attention to this matter, and I look forward to your response.\n\nKind regards,\n\nKaiser",
